     He's perfectly capable of using the stairs down, or of
jumping into trap doors and holes, and will do so if next
to such when sufficiently wounded.  (Unlike the stairs up,
he won't intentionally travel to any of those things, only
use them if near to them by coincidence.)  Once he is on a
different level from you, he won't come to your level if he
has the Amulet.

     Since does keep coming back, that means that he does
not have the Amulet.  You need to go find it.  It's either
on the floor where you dropped it, or where you killed the
Wizard and it fell with his corpse and you didn't notice,
or else some other monster has picked it up.  Most monsters
won't touch it, but some deliberately go after it and
others just like to pick up any magic trinket they find.


